645.</P></DIV1></DOC></BODY></GROUP> <GROUP><HEAD COM="0070">SERIES VICESIMA SECUNDA.</HEAD> <FRONT><DOC NAME="Praefatio" AUTHOR="Editores" TEMPSTAT=MOD SECOND=YES COM="0070"><COL N="0069"></COL> <HEAD TYPE=mainedit COM="0069">PRAEFATIO.</HEAD> <P COM="0069">Series haec duobus tantum constat Indicibus, quorum prior alphabeticus complectitur
