638; XLV, 1719.</ITEM></LIST></DOC> <DOC NAME="Index epistolarum dogmaticarum" AUTHOR="Editores" TEMPSTAT=MOD COM="0112" SECOND="NO"><COL N="0113"></COL> <HEAD TYPE=main COM="0113">CXCIX.
INDEX EPISTOLARUM DOGMATICARUM
ET POLEMICARUM,
IN QUO SERVATUR ORDO RERUM ANALOGICUS SIMUL AC CHRONOLOGICUS AUCTORUM.</HEAD> <DIV1 COM="0113" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0113">I. —  <HI REND="ITALIC">Epistolae dogmaticae.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0113"><HI REND="ITALIC">De Deo.</HI>  — De Deo, quod mentiri non potest, Ambrosius,
XVI, 1155. — De decem nominibus Dei, Hieronym.,
XXII, 428. — De hypostasibus,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  355, 358, 359. — De
Deo epistolae, S. August., XXXIII, 431, 452. — De
Deo videndo,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  378, 596, 622; S. Lupus Ferrar.,
CXIX, 493. — De Deo immenso, quomodo claudi potuerit
utero virginis, et infantis corpusculo, Volusian.,
XXXIII, 512; August.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  515. — De Deo colendo,
quo modo,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1030. — De praesentia Dei ubique,
et speciali ratione in sanctis ut in suo templo,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
832. — De ejus bonitate et justitia in hominum discretione,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  815, 857, 874, Ruricius, LVIII, 102. — De
uno Deo quaerendo, Guillelmus, abb. S. Arnulfi, CL, 880. — Providentiae
divinae omnia subjacere, Paulinus Nolanus,
LXI, 227. — An dici possit quod paternitas et
divinitas Deus non sit, Hildegardis, CXCVII, 351, 352.</P> <P COM="0113"><HI REND="ITALIC">De SS. Trinitatis mysterio.</HI>  — Julius papa I, VIII, 953;
Hieronymus, XXII, 355, 359; August., XXXIII, 75, 77,
449, 452, 742, 748, 1025, 1038, 1049, 1051; Hormisda
papa, LXIII, 476; Fulgentius, LXV, 394; Fulgentius
