Hormisda papa, LXXXIV, 813; Elipandus, XCVI, 861,
864; Guitmundus, episc. Aversan., CXLIX, 1501; Carolus
Magnus, XCVIII, 914; Hildegardis, CXCVII, 167; Augustinus,
XXXIII, 585, 718, 720.</P> <P COM="0113"><HI REND="ITALIC">De creatione mundi.</HI>  — Ambrosius, XVI, 1136. — De
creatione hominis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1129; Avitus Viennensis, LIX,
200. Hugo de Ribodimonte, CLXVI, 833. — De creatione
angelorum, Philippus de Harveng, CIII, 2.</P> <P COM="0113"><HI REND="ITALIC">De Christo.</HI>  — De Christi divinitate et humanitate, S.
Felix papa, V, 152, 155; S. Eutychianus papa,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
167; Caius papa,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  183; Liberius papa, VIII, 1395;
Athanasius,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1397; Damasus papa, XIII, 356; August.,
XXXIII, 75, 370, 381, 462, 515, 538, 585, 630, 709,
832, 899, 901, 904, 942; Capreolus, Carthagin., LIII, 843,
849; S. Leo Magnus, LIV, 757, 765, 771, 785, 797, 803,
928, 1065, 1163, 1165, 1173  <HI REND="ITALIC">et seq.,</HI>  1257, 1259; Avitus
Vienn., LIX, 205, 215, 245; Fulgent., LXV, 377, 405,
415, 493; Joannes II papa, LXVI, 20, 27; Agapetus I
