Petrus Blesens., CCVII, 358. — De impotentia in matrimonio,
Gregor. II, papa, LXXXIX, 524; Bonifacius,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
738, 739. — De impedimento, propinquitatis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  746. — Non
licere filium in matrimonium ducere illam quam
pater de sacro fonte baptismatis suscepit, Zacharias,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
955. — Abbonis matrimonium, in quarto consanguinitatis
gradu contractum, esse dissolvendum, Nicolaus papa I,
CXIX, 809. — Quam nefarium sit consanguineis copulari,
 <COL N="0115"></COL> Nicolaus papa I, CXIX, 1131. — Confirmatur matrimonium
cujusdam absente sacerdote contractum, Adrianus,
