Madaurensis et Augustinus, XXXIII, 81, 83. — De cultu
Mariae Virginis, Adamus, abbas Perseniae, CCXI, 612, 631.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0115" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0115">II. —  <HI REND="ITALIC">Epistolae polemicae.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0115">Quae spectant Novatianos, S. Cyprian., III, 700, 703,
