moliuntur, Leo papa, LXXXIV, 695.</P> <P COM="0116">Contra eos qui passibilem divinitatem unigeniti Filii
audent asserere, Leo papa, LXXXIV, 696. — Contra eos
qui duas quidem ante adunationem naturas Domini delirant,
unam vero post adunationem confingunt, Leo papa,
LXXXIV, 700. — Adversus id quod aiunt, animam hominis
ex divina esse substantia,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  748. — Contra illud
quod aiunt, diabolum ex se vel ex chao esse, et propriam
habere naturam,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  748. — Contra id quod
fatalibus stellis dicant animas hominum obligatas,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
 <COL N="0117"></COL> 750. — Adversus Monothelitarum haeresim, Maurus, archiep.
Ravenn., LXXXVII, 103; Martinus papa, LXXXVII,
146. — Adversus haeresim Felicianam, Adrianus papa,
XCVIII, 374. — Refellit quasdam assertiones Migetii haeretici
Elipandus, XCVI, 859. — Adversus errorem Adoptianorum,
Alcuinus, X, 168. — De disputatione Felicis
cum Saraceno, et cujusdam Judaei cum Petro magistro,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  313. — Errorem refutat eorum qui nolunt sacerdotibus
peccata confiteri,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  337. — De corpore et sanguine
Domini, adversus Ratpertum, Rabanus Maurus,
CXII, 1510. — Adversus Gothescalcum, Amulo, Lugdun.
episc., CXVI, 84. — De scriptis apostolorum, qua arte
compositis, Alverus Cordub., CXXI, 413, 427, 451; Joannes
Spelensis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  421. — De Psalmis, et Job historia,
an per humanum spiritum fuerint compositi, Cordub.,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  439, 451. — Adversus Praedestinatianos, Hincmarus
Rhem., CXXV, 49. — S. Hilarium defendit adversus Berengarii
calumnias Lanfrancus, CL, 543. — Insectatur
quemdam haereticum qui sanctorum invocationem impugnabat
Hildebert., CLXXI, 237. — Adversus eos qui ex
auctoritate Bedae presbyteri arguere conantur, Dionysium
Areopagitam fuisse Dionysium Corinthiorum episcopum,
Abaelardus, CLXXVIII, 341. — Contra errores P. Abaelardi,
S. Bernardus Claraev., CLXXXII, 349, 539, 542. — Contra
errores Arnaldi Brixiensis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  361, 363. — Adversus
errores Folmari praepositi Trieffensteinensis,
Gerhohus, CXCIII, 496. — Adversus Gerhohum asserentem
divinitatem in sacramento altaris a sumentibus vorari,
etc, CXCIII, 500, 514, 524, 530, 532. — Defendit
libros B. Hilarii de Trinitate Philippus de Harveng.
CCIII, 34, 46, 57, 170  <HI REND="ITALIC">seqq.</HI></P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0117" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0117">III. —  <HI REND="ITALIC">Epistolae exegeticae.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0117">De didrachmi dimidio quod Hebraeus praecipitur offerre
pro redemptione animae suae (Exod. XXX, 12  <HI REND="ITALIC">seqq.</HI> ), Ambrosius
XVI, 905. — De his verbis Psalmi:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Coeli enarrant
gloriam Dei, ibid.,</HI>  1020. — De mulieris adulterae
absolutione,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1041, 1044. — De his verbis Apostoli:
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Quod omnis creatura ingemiscit,</HI>  etc.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  XVI, 1077. — De
his verbis Apostoli:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Quia postulat pro nobis gemitibus
inenarrabilibus, ibid.,</HI>  1082. — De his verbis Apostoli:
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Filium factum fuisse servum maledictum opprobrium atque
peccatum,</HI>  etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1145. — De manna corporis
Dominici typo,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1219. — De hostiarum sanguine,
qualia figurabat,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1222. — De inauribus mulierum
in vituli caput conflatis, quid significent,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1224. — De
fractione tabularum et vituli comminutione, quid significent,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  — De his verbis Deuteronomii:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Ponam coelum
aereum, et terram ferream,</HI>  etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid,</HI>  1231. — De curatione
caeci a nativitate, quid figuret, Ambrosius, XVI,
1271. — De visione sexti capituli Isaiae prophetae, Hieronym.,
XXII, 361. — De voce Osanna. quid significet
juxta Hebraicum fontem,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  375; Damasus papa, XIII,
371. — De Evangelica parabola, quae est apud Lucam de
filio prodigo,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  379 — De voce Diapsalma,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  433. — De
Ephod et Theraphim,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  435. — De alphabeto
Hebraico Psalmi CXIII,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  441. — De aliquot locis
Psalmi CXXVI,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  448. — De quinque quaestionibus
ex Veteri Testamento desumptis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  451. — De commentariis
Rethicii in Canticum Canticorum,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  461. — De
his verbis Matthaei:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Nolite solliciti esse de crastino,</HI> 
etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  560. — De his verbis Pauli apostoli:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Omne
peccatum quod fecerit homo extra corpus est. Qui autem
fornicatur in corpus suum peccat,</HI>  etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  561. — De
his verbis ejusdem apostoli:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Oportet eum regnare, donec
ponat inimicos suos sub pedibus suis,</HI>  etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  564. — De
nova post LXX Veteris Testamenti versione,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
565. — De Petro reprehenso a Paulo  <CITN>(Galat. II)</CITN> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
916, 936; August., XXXIII, 111, 154, 251, 273. — De
quibusdam quaestionibus Novi Testamenti, S. Ambros.
XVI, 586. — De explanatione Psalmi XLIV,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  622. — De
Salomone et Achaz, an eos undecimo aetatis anno
filios genuisse credendum sit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  673. — De jurgio
duarum meretricum et judicio Salomonis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  682. — De
XLII mansionibus Israelitarum in deserto,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  698. — Quaestiones
de Psalmis solvuntur,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  837. — Inter
varias lectiones Graecas atque Latinas, quaenam sit caeteris
praeferenda,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  837.</P> <P COM="0117">De his verbis Apostoli:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Omnes quidem dormiemus,</HI>  etc.,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  966. — De his verbis Matthaei:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Non bibam amodo
de hoc genimine vitis, usque in illum diem,</HI>  etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
982. — De resurrectione et apparitione Domini, cur
evangelistae diversa narraverint,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  986, 987, 988, 990,
991. — De his verbis Matthaei evangelistae:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Jesus autem
clamans voce magna emisit spiritum,</HI>  etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  991. — Quomodo
 <COL N="0118"></COL> Salvator, secundum Joannem insufflat Spiritum
sanctum apostolis, et secundum Lucam post ascensionem
missurum se esse dicit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  993. — De his verbis
Pauli apostoli:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Numquid iniquitas apud Deum,</HI>  etc.,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  997. — De his verbis ejusdem Apostoli:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Aliis odor
mortis in mortem et aliis odor vitae in vitam,</HI>  etc,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
1001. — De his verbis Pauli apostoli:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Ipse autem Deus
pacis sanctificet vos per omnia,</HI>  etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1004. — De
his verbis Matthaei:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Arundinem quassatum non confringet,</HI> 
etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1010. — De his verbis Matthaei:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Si quis
vult post me venire,</HI>  etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1013. — De his verbis
Matthaei:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Vae praegnantibus et nutrientibus in illis diebus,</HI> 
etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1014. — Quid sit villicus iniquitatis, qui Domini
voce laudatus est,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1018. — De his verbis Pauli
apostoli:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Vix enim pro justo quis moritur; nam pro bono
forsitan quis audeat mori,</HI>  etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1021. — De his
verbis Pauli:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Optabam ego ipse anathema esse pro fratribus
meis,</HI>  etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1027. — De verbis ejusdem
Apostoli:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Nisi discessio venerit primum, et revelatus
fuerit homo peccati,</HI>  etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1035. — De terra promissionis,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1099. — De his verbis S. Jacobi:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Qui
offenderit in uno, factus est omnium reus,</HI>  etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
1138; S. August., XXXIII, 733. — De expositione Psalmi
octogesimi noni, cujus initium est,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Domine, refugium
factus es nobis,</HI>  etc., S. Ambros., XVI, 1166. — De eo
quod scriptum est:  <HI REND="ITALIC">In qua mensura mensi fueritis, remetietur
vobis,</HI>  etc, S. Augustinus, XXXIII, 379. — De hebdomadibus
Danielis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  899, 901, 904. — Allegoria de
Jona absorpto a ceto,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  382. — Aliquot quaestiones
solvuntur de Psalmis, de Apostolo, de Evangelio,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
462, 630; Paulinus, LXI, 408. — De Psalmi XXI interpretatione,
S. August., XXXIII, 538. — De decem virginibus,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  574. — De his verbis Joannis:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Et Verbum caro
factum est,</HI>  etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  539. — De his verbis Pauli:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Secundum
Evangelium quidem inimici propter vos; secundum
electionem dilecti propter patres,</HI>  etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  637. — De
his verbis Pauli:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Si tu cum Judaeus sis gentiliter vivis
et non judaice, quomodo gentes cogis judaizare,</HI>  etc.,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid,</HI>  251, 275. — De his verbis S. Joannis evangelistae:
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Aqua quam ego dabo, fiet in eo fons,</HI>  etc, Ruricius, episc.,
LVIII, 109. — De filio prodigo,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  70. — De his verbis
Matthaei:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Ecce mater tua, et fratres tui quaerunt te,</HI> 
etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  90. — De initio Evangelii Joannis, Paulinus,
LXI, 250. — Historia Samsonis et mulieris peccatricis
ad Christi pedes allegorice exposita,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  256. — Verba
Joelis de eruca, locusta, brucho et rubigine, quomodo
explicantur,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  363. — Expositio moralis Psalmi CI,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  367. — Parabola de prudentibus quinque totidemque
