numerorum Veteris et Novi Testamenti,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
476. — De his verbis Psalmi XXI:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Deus, Deus meus,
quare me dereliquisti?</HI>  Alvarus Cordub., CXXI, 414. — Arcana
