est eos qui semel sunt illuminati,</HI>  etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
1013. — Super Evangelio Lucae, cap. XVII, 1, 9:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Homo
quidam erat dives,</HI>  etc., S. Bernard. Claraev., CLXXXII,
661. — De expositione Psalmi CXXXI, Gerhohus, CXCIII,
564. — De his verbis Psalmi IV:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Ut justificeris in sermonibus
tuis,</HI>  etc., Gerhohus, CXCIII, 607, 611. — Explicat
quemdam Psalmi versiculum:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Tollite portas, principes,
vestras,</HI>  etc., Otto, episc. Frisingensis, CLXXXIX, 1388.</P></DIV1></DOC> <DOC NAME="Index epistolarum circa moralem et philosophiam" AUTHOR="Editores" TEMPSTAT=MOD COM="0118" SECOND="NO"><COL N="0119"></COL> <HEAD TYPE=main COM="0119">CC.
