I, papa, CXIX, 773; S. Gregorius II, papa, LXXXIX,
507, 511, 521.</P></DOC> <DOC NAME="Index epistolarum de diversis argumentis" AUTHOR="Editores" TEMPSTAT=MOD COM="0130" SECOND="NO"><COL N="0131"></COL> <HEAD TYPE=main COM="0131">CCIV.
