169. — Abbates excitat ad strenue curandum negotium,
cujus causa convenerunt,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  222. — Dehortatur ducem
Conradum a bello inferendo comiti Gebennensi,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  229. — Hortatur Gualterum de Calvo-Monte ad fugam
saeculi,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  238. — Henricum Murdach excitat ad
