Ecclesiae patrimonium commendat,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1130. — Post
amicissimam salutationem Candidum presbyterum
commendat,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1031. — Theodoram viduam commendat,
ne, ob ingratum filii animum, cui nubenti sua
donaverat omnia, inopiam patiatur,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1032. — Commendat
monachos ad Augustinum in Anglia missos,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
1173, 1174, 1179. — Commendat Augustinum episcopum,
si ad eum venerit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1208. — Aurelium presbyterum
commendat, ut ei oratorium vel locum aliquem committat,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1210. — Maurentii homines commendat,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1222. — Romani
expraetoris homines ac possessiones commendat,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1246. — A monophysitarum errore conversos
commendat,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid,</HI>  1252. — Romanam Ecclesiam
