 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  122. — Causam episcopi Meldensis commendat,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  124. — Humberti cujusdam causam commendat,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  141. — Diversorum causas Theobaldo commendat,
