Romanae praestita,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1188. — Gratias agit, petitque
ut Bertrada regina Itherii fidem remuneretur,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
1218. — Epistola Adriani papae in qua continentur gratiarum
actiones pro cruce quam ei miserat, XCVIII, 396. — Gratias
agit pro dono. Alcuinus, C, 212. — Gratias
agit pro bonis acceptis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  300, 303, 348, 372, 455. — Gratias
agit ob lectum et remissum libellum adversus
Felicem,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  313. — Gratias agit pro cruce donata,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  362. — Pro cappa et aliis donis gratias agit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
363, 406. — Gratias agit pro charitatis muneribus,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid,</HI> 
445 — Pro herbis medicinalibus gratias refert,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
