INDEX INVENTIONUM
DE QUIBUS MENTIO FIT IN PATROLOGIA, QUO SCILICET INNOTESCUNT
ILLARUM AUCTORES, TEMPUS, ET SCRIPTORES QUI ILLAS MEMORARUNT.</HEAD> <P COM="0441">(Ann. 160.) Tertullianus. — Divinatio. daemoniorum
praestigiis divinantes ( <HI REND="ITALIC">tables tournantes</HI> ), I, 411. — Angeli
desertores metallorum opera denudarunt, herbarum
ingenia traduxerunt, et incantationum vires provulgarunt,
et omnem curiositatem usque ad stellarum
interpretationem designarunt,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  459 et 1306. — Aesculapius
medicinarum demonstrator,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  413; II, 87,
88. — Primus medelas exploravit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  87. — Anatomia
veteribus nota,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  662, 692. — Seres arbores nere
credebant,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1305. — Tyrii lanas tingebant,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  — Phryges
insuebant,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  — Babylonii intexebant,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  — Arachnae
officina, II, 1309. — Aries, machina bellica, a
Carthaginensibus inventa,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1032. — Archimedis
organum hydraulicum,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  669. — Simulacra a Tuscis
inventa,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  430. — Fiebant ex terrena ac vili
materia, et vasculis communi ac vilissimo usui destinatis,
I, 399. — Nulla deorum simulacra simulacra olim apud Romanos,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  430, 608. — Sive ante Numam Pompilium,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  — Antequam
ad hominis efficta sint similitudinem,
quam ridicula fuerint,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid., 339, 366 seqq.,</HI>  578.</P> <P COM="0441">(Ann. 300.) Minucius Felix. — Saturnus docuit litteras
imprimere, nummos signare, III, 308, 309.</P> <P COM="0441"><COL N="0442"></COL> (Ann. 300.) Arnobius, rhetor Carthaginensis. — Aescu
lapius, medicaminum repertor, V, 770.</P> <P COM="0442">(Ann. 317.) Lactantius. — Aesculapius invenit medicinam,
VI, 213. — Vulcanus invenit fabricam,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  — Minerva
reperit artes,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  213, 214. — Venus artem
meretriciam instituit uti vulgato corpore quaestum facerent,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  207. — Ceres ac Liber fruges ac vinum tradiderunt,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  213. — Stercutus stercorandi agri rationem
primus induxit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  227. — Numa Pompilius cultus
