 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  777. — Varia divinationum genera,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI> 
761. — Causae divinationum,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  762. — Poenitentia
quae, iis qui divinationes expetunt,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  746. — De multiplici
genere divinationum,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1318. — Quot modis
