VARIAS ILLORUM TRANSMIGRATIONES, HABITUS, MORES, USUS, ETC.</HEAD> <DIV1 COM="0509" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0509">TERTULLIANUS.</HEAD> <P COM="0509">Aegyptiorum regnum Romano antiquius, I, 432.</P> <P COM="0509">Aegyptus incolam habuit Chaldaeum genus, II, 1035.</P> <P COM="0509">Aegyptus et Aethiopia, omnis gens vocatur, a specie ad
