ad sexum pertinet, non ad gradum sexus,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  895.</P> <P COM="0519">Thebis hebetes et brutas nasci relatum est, II, 683.</P> <P COM="0519">Vitalia pro cujusque generis dispositione omnibus propria
animalibus temperavit, artifex Deus, II, 662.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0519" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0519">LACTANTIUS.</HEAD> <P COM="0519">Adamus. — De ejus vita in paradio, VI, 322. — Utrum
