Maur., CXI, 524, 525, 526. — Casia herba quae et fistula
in aquis nascitur, concava est, in immensum crescit,
Hugo de S. Victore, CLXXVII, 140.</P> <P COM="0533"><HI REND="ITALIC">Castanea</HI>  ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kavstanon</FOREIGN> ), S. Isidor., LXXXII, 613, Raban,
