LXXXII, 625.</P> <P COM="0534"><HI REND="ITALIC">Erlizbaum</HI>  S. Hildegard., CXCVII, 1240.</P> <P COM="0534"><HI REND="ITALIC">Erigeron</HI>  nomen a Graecis dicitur quod vere primo senescat,
S. Isidor., LXXXII, 630.</P> <P COM="0534"><HI REND="ITALIC">Erodium</HI>  Cicutarium (cramchnabel), S. Hildegard.,
CXCVII, 1188.</P> <P COM="0534"><HI REND="ITALIC">Eruca</HI>  quasi  <HI REND="ITALIC">urnea</HI>  quod ignitae sit virtutis; hujus species
