CXCVII, 1141.</P> <P COM="0534"><HI REND="ITALIC">Euphorbia</HI>  esula (wulffesmilch), S. Hildegard., CXCVII,
1149.</P> <P COM="0534"><HI REND="ITALIC">Euphorbia</HI>  lathyris (Springwurtz) S. Hildegard., CXCVII,
1184.</P> <P COM="0534"><HI REND="ITALIC">Euphorbium</HI>  dictum et ejus succus ocrilorum acuat visum,
S. Isidor., LXXXII, 627.</P> <P COM="0534"><HI REND="ITALIC">Evonymos</HI>  Europaea (Kynelbaum), S. Hildeg., CXCVII,
