LXXXII, 710.</P> <P COM="0549"><HI REND="ITALIC">Mala</HI>  a rotunditate sui vocata, ut mala pomorum, S.
 <COL N="0550"></COL> Isidorus, LXXXII, 718; Rabanus Maurus, CXI, 603.</P> <P COM="0550"><HI REND="ITALIC">Mulgarium</HI>  vas in quo mulgentur pecora, S. Isidorus,
