LXXXII, 710.</P> <P COM="0551"><HI REND="ITALIC">Putare</HI>  est virgam ex vite supervacuam resecare, cujus
flagellis luxuriat, S. Isidorus, LXXXII, 606; Rabanus
Maurus, CXI, 597.</P> <P COM="0551"><HI REND="ITALIC">Pyxide,</HI>  svascula unguentaria ex buxo ( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>puvxon</FOREIGN> ) facta, S.
