ORDINE LOGICO DIGESTUS.</HEAD> <DIV1 COM="0577" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0577">I. —  <HI REND="ITALIC">De mensuris in genere.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0577">Mensurae definitiones variae, Boetius, LXIII, 1307,
