S. Bibiani,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  74. — Basilica S. Eutropii,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  76. — Basilica Parisiaca,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  104. — Basilica S.
Georgii,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  107. — Basilica aedificata a Bugge, filia regis
Angliae, S. Aldhelmus episc. Shireburnensis, LXXXIX,
289 290; Liber diurnus Rom. Pontificum, CV, 93, 94;
Anastasius Bibliothecarius, CXXVII, CXXVIII,  <HI REND="ITALIC">passim.</HI>  — Basilicae
S. Remigii Remensis dedicatio, Anselmus
monachus S. Remigii Remensis, CXLII, 1415, 1416; Leo
Marcianus, monachus Casinensis, CLXXIII, 997-998. — Descriptio
eccles. S. Dionysii. Sugerius, abbas S. Dionysii,
CLXXXVI, 1227  <HI REND="ITALIC">seq.</HI>  — De consecratione Ecclesiae
a se aedificatae,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1339, 1240 — Descriptio ecclesiae Lateranensis,
Joannes Diaconus, CXCIV, 1543-1544. — De
casu fu minis super eccles. monasterii, S. Laurentii Leodiensis,
Reinerus, monachus, CCIV, 137. — De dedicatione
nova Ecclesiae ejusdem monast.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  145, 146. — De incendio
eccles. S. Lamberti Leodiensis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  151-152.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0587" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0587"><HI REND="ITALIC">Calcei.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0587">Baxa et soccus quotidie deaurantur, Tertullianus, I,
670. — Calcei seu Baxa philosophorum deaurati, id., II,
1043. — Tyri auro calceabantur,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1043. — De calceamentis,
S. Isidorus, LXXXII, 704. — Sutores, Caligarius,
calceamenta, crepidae, calcei, patritii calcei, ocreae,
cothurni,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  704. — Baxeae, talares, obstrigilli, ossae,
mullei,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  705. — Soleae, socci, caliculae, caligae, cernui,
cingulati, clavati, perones, baxeae, corrigiae, caligulae,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  706. — De calceamentis, B. Rabanus Maurus, CXI,
585.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0587" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0587"><HI REND="ITALIC">Calices.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0587">Calices primitivae ecclesiae boni Pastoris imaginem
sculptam prae se ferebant, Tertullianus, II, 1000; S. Damasus
papa, VIII, 801; S. Aldhelmus, episc. Shireburn.
LXXXIX, 298; S. Angilbertus, abbas Centul., XCIX,
846.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0587" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0587"><HI REND="ITALIC">Campanae, cloccae.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0587">Restauratio monasterii S. Richarii, S. Angilbertus,
abbas Centulensis, XCIX, 847; Rupertus, abbas Tuitiensis,
CLXX, 19, 20; Reinerus, monach. S. Laurentii Leodiensis,
CCIV, 153.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0587" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0587"><HI REND="ITALIC">Cappae seu pluvialia</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0587">De restauratione monast. S. Richarii, S. Angilbertus,
abbas Centul., XCIX, 847.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0587" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0587"><HI REND="ITALIC">Casulae</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0587">De restauratione monasterii S. Richarii, hodie Ambianensis
seminarii minoris, S. Angilbertus, abbas Centulensis,
XCIX, 847.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0587" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0587"><HI REND="ITALIC">Ceramica.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0587">Samia vasa, Tertullianus, I, 430, 607. — De vasis
 <COL N="0588"></COL> escariis, S. Isidorus, LXXXII, 714. — Fictilia vasa, in
insula Samo inventa, antiquior usus fictilium vasorum
quam fundendi aeris aut argenti,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  714. — Aretina vasa,
