paropsis, patina, gabata, concha, scutella, apophoreta,
salinum, acetabulum,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  715. — Cochlear, triscelas
seu tripodes,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  716. — De vasis potoriis, poculum,
phialae,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  716. — Paterae, cratera, cyathi, scyphi,
cymbia, amystis, baccea, calices, calathi, scalae, ampulla,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  — De vinariis et aquariis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  — Oenophorus,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  — Phlascae, lagena, sicula, cantharus, hydria, situla,
cadum, catinum, orca, urceus, urceolus, scyphus
seriola, dolium, cupi et cupae, mulgarium, multrum, labrum,
labellum, alveum, pelvis, siphon,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  717. — De
vasis oleariis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  718. — Hemicadium scortea, alabastrum,
pyxides, lenticula,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  — De vasis coquinariis,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  — Cocula in genere, olla, fratella, cacabus, cucuma,
lebetes, sartago, tripodes, molae,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  — Cribrum, rotabulum,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  719. — De vasis escariis, Rabanus Maurus,
CXI, 597. — De vasis pototariis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  599. — De vasis
vinariis, sive aquariis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  600. — De vasis oleariis,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  602. — De vasis coquinariis et pistoriis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0588" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0588"><HI REND="ITALIC">Cerei.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0588">Lychnorum descriptio, S. Paulinus Nolanus, LXI, 467,
491, 535, 536. (Videsis  <HI REND="ITALIC">Indicem Liturgicum.</HI> )</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0588" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0588"><HI REND="ITALIC">Circus.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0588">Circi factonum colores, Tertullianus, I, 641. — Circi
gradus et Apuliae,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  652.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0588" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0588"><HI REND="ITALIC">Civitates.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0588">Civitatum fundationes, S. Isidorus, LXXXII, 527  <HI REND="ITALIC">seq.</HI>  — De
civitatum nominibus,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  536. — Civitas, urbs,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  — Oppidum,
colonia, municipium, vicus, castrum, castellum,
pagi, compita, suburbana,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  537.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0588" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0588"><HI REND="ITALIC">Colores vestium.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0588">Tinctura, coccum, seu rubrum sive vermiculum, conchylium,
ostrum, S. Isidorus, LXXXII, 695. — Purpura,
ferrugo, glaucus color, elbidum, luteus, menum,
masticinum, blatteum, blavum, mesticium, osticium,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  696; Rabanus Maurus, CXI, 579.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0588" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0588"><HI REND="ITALIC">Constructio aedificiorum.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0588">Constructio, structio, aedificatio, instauratio, fundamentum,
caementum, lapides, S. Isidorus, LXXXII, 672; Rabanus
Maurus, CXI, 560.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0588" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0588"><HI REND="ITALIC">Dalmatica.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0588">Dalmatica diaconi uti debent in ecclesia, S. Damasus
papa, VIII, 802. — Restauratio monasterii S. Richarii,
S. Angilbertus abbas Centul., XCIX, 847.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0588" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0588"><HI REND="ITALIC">Dispositio aedificiorum.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0588">Videsis S. Isidorus, LXXXII, 672; Rabanus Maurus,
CXI, 559.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0588" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0588"><HI REND="ITALIC">Domus, domus partes.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0588">Vestibula Romanorum clarissimis et elatissimis lucernis
illuminabantur, Tertullianus, I, 459. — Descriptio  <HI REND="ITALIC">tugurii</HI> 
in Africa, cujus tectum in modum carinae navis incurvatur,
Sulpitius Severus, XX, 186. — Descriptio domus ruris
positae, Sidonius Apollinaris, LVIII, 473  <HI REND="ITALIC">seq.</HI>  — Domorum
constructio, Cassiodorus, LXIX, 520. — Domus
novae super antiquos muros,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  629.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0588" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0588"><HI REND="ITALIC">Evangeliarium perantiquum.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0588">(Videsis S. Eusebius, XII, 141 seq.)</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0588" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0588"><HI REND="ITALIC">Fenestrae coloratae.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0588">De fenestris coloratis, Sidonius Apollinaris, LVIII,
487. — Basilica aedificata a Bugge filia regis Angliae, S.
Aldhelmus, episc. Shireburn., LXXXIX, 290. — De
