Dionysii describuntur, Sugerius, abbas S. Dionysii,
CLXXXVI, 1231,  <HI REND="ITALIC">seq.</HI></P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0588" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0588"><HI REND="ITALIC">Figulinae.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0588">Theodoricus figulinas concedit et protegit, Cassiodorus,
LXIX, 558.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0588" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0588"><HI REND="ITALIC">Fadinae, metalla.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0588">De cultu feminarum; Angeli mali metalla denudarunt,
Tertullianus, I, 1306. — Ferrariae venae inquirendae, Cassiodorus,
LXIX, 590. — Fodinae rusticianae,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  768. — Metella
aurum, argentum, electrum, stannum, plumbum, ferrum,
