 <HI REND="ITALIC">Dialogi</HI>  Minucii Felicis a Johan. Gottlieb. Lindero, 225
 <HI REND="ITALIC">seqq.</HI></P> <P COM="0647"><HI REND="ITALIC">Latinae dictiones.</HI>  — Autumnitas, III, 286. Blanditur
illis pavorem, 259 not. Convivium caluit, 263 not. Cantabra,
quid, 332 not. Crispis torosisque fluctibus, 239.
