(disciplina), 148. Palingenesiam, id est, regenerationem,
142.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Panhgurikwvteron</FOREIGN>  id est, laudatissime, 212. Parergon,
id est, opus, 141. Pegmata, theatri machinae, 174. Pelorio
ostreae majoris genus, Graece  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>pelwvrioû</FOREIGN>  monstrosus, admirandus,
147. Phalerae loquendi, pro stylo ornato et nitido,
a  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>favlara</FOREIGN> , 173.</P> <P COM="0661"><HI REND="ITALIC">Latinitas Symmachiana.</HI>  — Adorea proprie merces
victori adjudicata, quae frumenti quaedam mensura erat,
ab adore frumentum; pro gloria militari sumitur, 175.
