not.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>2Omoouvsion</FOREIGN> , 830 not.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Oujsiva</FOREIGN> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  Paracletus, an
