25, 499. Ogdoas 23.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>4Ulhû</FOREIGN>  abyssi, 387.</P> <P COM="0711"><HI REND="ITALIC">Latinae voces.</HI>  — Aequinoctium, 506. Aperissem pro aperuissem,
