liber dictus  <HI REND="ITALIC">Scito teipsum,</HI>  633. Heloissae Paraclitensis
diaconissae problemata, 677. Expositio in Hexaemeron,
729. Expositio in Epist. ad Romanos, 783. Introductio
ad Theologiam, 979. Theologia Christiana, 1113.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Sic et
